%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-objects-functions-mergewith (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (表記のみ: 引用符・括弧・書式の違いで、値は同じ)
doc の Output:
  "mergeWith": {
      "b": 1,
      "a": false,
      "c": "Test"
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import mergeWith from dw::core::Objects
output application/json
---
{ "mergeWith" : { "a" : true, "b" : 1} mergeWith { "a" : false, "c" : "Test"} }
%%% output application/json
{
  "mergeWith": {
    "b": 1,
    "a": false,
    "c": "Test"
  }
}
